---
import SiteLayout from '@/layouts/SiteLayout.astro';

const updated = 'July 18, 2026';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | nPower Software"
  description="Learn how IntegrityWare, Inc. and nPower Software collect, use, and protect information when you visit the Power Surfacing website."
  canonicalPath="/privacy"
>
  <article class="bg-white py-16 md:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-red-600 mb-3">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 mb-3">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-10">Last updated: {updated}</p>

      <div class="legal-copy space-y-9 text-slate-700 leading-7">
        <section>
          <h2>Overview</h2>
          <p>
            IntegrityWare, Inc., operating the nPower Software and Power Surfacing website
            (collectively, “we,” “us,” or “our”), respects your privacy. This policy explains
            the information we may collect through this website, how we use it, and the choices
            available to you.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Information you provide</h2>
          <p>We may receive information that you choose to provide when you:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>contact sales or technical support;</li>
            <li>request a product demonstration, trial, download, or pricing information;</li>
            <li>subscribe to product updates or newsletters; or</li>
            <li>communicate with us by email, telephone, or another channel.</li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            This information may include your name, email address, company, telephone number,
            product interests, support details, and the contents of your message.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Information collected automatically</h2>
          <p>
            Our hosting and service providers may process standard technical information such as
            your IP address, browser type, device information, referring page, requested pages,
            and timestamps for security, reliability, and operational purposes. The website may
            also use browser storage to cache video-library information and remember interface
            preferences.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>How we use information</h2>
          <p>We may use information to:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>respond to inquiries and provide sales or technical support;</li>
            <li>deliver requested product information, trials, updates, or communications;</li>
            <li>operate, secure, troubleshoot, and improve the website and our services;</li>
            <li>maintain business records and protect our legal rights; and</li>
            <li>comply with applicable law.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Service providers and external content</h2>
          <p>
            We may share information with service providers that help us host the website, deliver
            communications, provide customer support, or operate our business. The website also
            uses or links to third-party services and content, including Google Maps, Google Fonts,
            YouTube, and Base44-hosted resources. Those providers may receive technical information
            when your browser requests their content, and their own privacy policies apply.
          </p>
          <p>We do not sell personal information for money.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Retention and security</h2>
          <p>
            We retain personal information only as long as reasonably necessary for the purposes
            described in this policy, including support, business-record, security, and legal
            requirements. We use reasonable administrative and technical safeguards, but no
            internet transmission or storage system can be guaranteed completely secure.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Your choices</h2>
          <p>
            You may ask to access, correct, or delete personal information you have provided, or
            opt out of marketing communications, by contacting us. Depending on where you live,
            applicable law may provide additional privacy rights. We may need to verify your
            identity before completing a request.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Children’s privacy</h2>
          <p>
            This website is intended for business and professional audiences and is not directed
            to children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children
            under 13 through the website.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
          <p>
            We may update this policy as our website or practices change. The “Last updated” date
            above identifies the current version.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Contact us</h2>
          <p>
            For privacy questions or requests, email
            <a href="mailto:info@npowersoftware.com">info@npowersoftware.com</a> or write to
            IntegrityWare, Inc., P.O. Box 722962, San Diego, CA 92172-2962, United States.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</SiteLayout>

<style>
  .legal-copy h2 { font-size: 1.35rem; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(15 23 42); margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  .legal-copy p + p { margin-top: 0.75rem; }
  .legal-copy ul { list-style: disc; padding-left: 1.5rem; margin: 0.75rem 0; }
  .legal-copy li + li { margin-top: 0.35rem; }
  .legal-copy a { color: rgb(220 38 38); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
</style>
